<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0265_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\n{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} is holdin’ somethin’...\rYou want it?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} hype it found\nsomethin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! It lookin’ just too important to let\ngo! It’s a hoarder!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} proudly handed it over!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">..................\nOh?\r{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} is holdin’ some kinda\nstrange, Shiny Leaf...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s lookin’ at you and noddin’.\nRespect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strange sound is comin’ from\n{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} is growlin’ in a way that\nsounds almost like speech...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? It lookin’ like it heard roarin’ in\nthe distance!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} straight forgot that it was\nholdin’ that {STRVAR_1 8, 4, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00010" index="10">
